{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14851","headline":"陈翃郎中北亭送侯钊侍御赋得带冰流歌 · 卢纶","name":"陈翃郎中北亭送侯钊侍御赋得带冰流歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪中鸟鸣春景旦，一派寒冰忽开散。\n璧方镜员流不断，白云鳞鳞满河汉。\n叠处浅，旋处深。\n撇捩寒鱼上复沈，羣鹅鼓舞扬清音。\n主人有客簪白笔，玉壶贮水光如一。\n持此赠君君饮之，圣君识君冰玉姿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}